<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African June trade data to be released on Monday.</title>
<headline>S.African June trade data to be released on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's June trade balance data would be released at 1200 GMT on Monday, a Customs and Excise official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The data had been tentatively scheduled for release in the latter half of this week.</p>
<p>Economists polled by Reuters forecast a 1.28 billion rand surplus in June compared with May's 1.75 billion rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
